<title>GERMANY: Buba's Issing to participate in forum on Euro.</title>
<headline>Buba's Issing to participate in forum on Euro.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank chief economist Otmar Issing will participate on Tuesday in a forum discussing the position of Europe's future common currency, the euro, within global foreign exchange markets.</p>
<p>The forum is sponsored by the Adolf Weber Foundation and will be held in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>German Finance Ministry representative Klaus Regling and Dresdner Bank management board member Gerd Haeusler are also scheduled to attend.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
